[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 484.15, "timestamp": "00:08:04", "text": "抱歉，我不會……但是你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 498.23, "timestamp": "00:08:18", "text": "，Pog。 Pog 的意思是快樂，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 511.83, "timestamp": "00:08:31", "text": "Pog pog 就像是「耶」。  就像很棒或類似的意思。即將到達。是的，我在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 513.67, "timestamp": "00:08:33", "text": "入侵別人的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 516.23, "timestamp": "00:08:36", "text": "系統。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 518.31, "timestamp": "00:08:38", "text": "所以，非常感謝。附近有很多玩家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 520.63, "timestamp": "00:08:40", "text": "我覺得他挺友善的。你還好嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 523.67, "timestamp": "00:08:43", "text": "？你做得很好。是的。  做得非常棒。別死。好的。"}]